<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_2_1_2" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-02">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_2_1_2">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_2_1_2" name="2.1.2 Drilling Execution" processRef="Process_L3_2_1_2"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_2_1_2" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L3/L2/L1/L0 Process. Physical drilling of each hole in the approved pattern, generating Measure-While-Drilling (MWD) telemetry as the primary high-frequency data output. Drill guidance systems navigate rigs to collar coordinates and capture downhole data in real time.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_2_1_2">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_1_2_rig" name="Drill Rig Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_2_1_2_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_1_2_eng" name="Drill &amp; Blast Engineer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_2_1_2_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_2_r</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_2_1_2_s" name="Drill plan dispatched by FMS">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1" name="2.1.2.1 Navigate Drill Rig to Hole">
      <bpmn:documentation>FMS dispatches drill rig to the target hole collar coordinates. Operator navigates using onboard GPS guidance displayed on the drill guidance system console, aligning the drill steel to the staked collar within specified tolerance (typically ±0.3 m). Tramming time is classified as Non-Productive Operating Time (NP) per GMG TUM.
ISA-95 level: 2 / 1
Actors: Drill Rig Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (Non-Productive Time — NP); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_2" name="2.1.2.2 Drill Hole with MWD Capture">
      <bpmn:documentation>Drill rig executes rotary or rotary-percussive drilling of the hole from collar to designed depth. The drill guidance system captures Measure-While-Drilling (MWD) parameters at 1-second intervals throughout the hole: weight-on-bit (WOB), rotational torque, penetration rate (ROP), rotation speed (RPM), bit air pressure, and vibration index. MWD data provides a real-time proxy for rock hardness, density, and alteration variation with depth. This is Productive Time (PT) per GMG TUM.
ISA-95 level: 1 / 0
Actors: Drill Rig Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (Productive Time — PT); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data (MWD data elements)
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: drill_mwd_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_3" name="2.1.2.3 Measure Hole Depth and Water">
      <bpmn:documentation>On completion of drilling, operator measures the as-drilled depth using drill string length or down-hole measurement, and records the presence and depth of any standing water in the hole. Water depth is critical input to explosive product selection (wet vs. dry hole classification).
ISA-95 level: 1 / 0
Actors: Drill Rig Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 1 (measurement)
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1" name="Pattern complete?" default="Flow_L3_2_1_2_6">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_5</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_4" name="2.1.2.4 Validate Hole Quality">
      <bpmn:documentation>Drill &amp; Blast supervisor or engineer reviews as-drilled hole data (depth, collar deviation, water) against design specification and accepts or rejects each hole. Out-of-tolerance holes (short depth, collar displacement, collapsed walls) are flagged for remediation or redesign. Generates the QC-accepted hole record.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Drill &amp; Blast Engineer; Drill &amp; Blast Supervisor
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3 (quality management)
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (drill_hole status)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2" name="All holes pass QC?" default="Flow_L3_2_1_2_8">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_8</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_2_1_2_e" name="QC-approved drill holes">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_8</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_2_r" name="Remediate or redesign rejected holes">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_2_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_2_10</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_2_1_2_s" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_2" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_4" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_3" targetRef="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_5" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_6" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_7" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_4" targetRef="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_8" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2" targetRef="End_L3_2_1_2_e"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_9" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_r"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_10" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_r" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_2_1_2">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_2_1_2" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_2_1_2">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_2_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_2_1_2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="36" width="1468" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_1_2_rig_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_1_2_rig" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="36" width="1428" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_1_2_eng_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_1_2_eng" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="236" width="1428" height="310"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_2_1_2_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_2_1_2_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="103" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="165" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_1"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="91" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_2"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="91" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_3"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="91" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g1" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="96" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="805" y="172" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_2_2_1_2_4"><dc:Bounds x="954" y="291" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_2_1_2_g2" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="1160" y="296" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1145" y="262" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_2_1_2_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_2_1_2_e"><dc:Bounds x="1351" y="303" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1329" y="365" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_2_r_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_2_r"><dc:Bounds x="1294" y="416" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="131"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="131"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="131"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="131"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_3"><di:waypoint x="578" y="131"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="131"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_4"><di:waypoint x="784" y="131"/><di:waypoint x="820" y="131"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_5"><di:waypoint x="855" y="96"/><di:waypoint x="855" y="20"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="20"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="91"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="861" y="76" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_6"><di:waypoint x="890" y="131"/><di:waypoint x="936" y="131"/><di:waypoint x="936" y="331"/><di:waypoint x="954" y="331"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="894" y="111" width="28" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_7"><di:waypoint x="1124" y="331"/><di:waypoint x="1160" y="331"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_8"><di:waypoint x="1230" y="331"/><di:waypoint x="1351" y="331"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1234" y="311" width="28" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_9_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_9"><di:waypoint x="1195" y="366"/><di:waypoint x="1195" y="456"/><di:waypoint x="1294" y="456"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1201" y="372" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_2_10_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_2_10"><di:waypoint x="1379" y="496"/><di:waypoint x="1379" y="562"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="562"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="171"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
